{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年43歲的賈曉晨（JJ）與樊少皇於2016年結婚，婚後育有兩女「小飯兜」及「小飯團」，組成四口美滿之家。擁有一半回族血統的賈曉晨，婚前是圈中公認的高顏值女神。婚後她逐漸將生活重心移至家庭，專心相夫教女，一家四口與現居內地，生活低調而幸福。近日賈曉晨發文透露愛犬離世，令她傷心欲絕。</p><figure><img alt=\"一家四口好幸福。（賈曉晨微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250222/970011544609886208685243.jpeg/dmxSKW-ELJ7pohqm9rG9pYHJMsrWJ-GLjyI-kY8iPpE\"/><figcaption>一家四口好幸福。（賈曉晨微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"JJ賈曉晨與《再見UFO》劇組一同踏上金像獎紅地氈。（IG@jj_fatumai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260422/1123614132403179520026587.jpeg/1Ol0Y_UxF1nZmEFgIOhJ62YJ9ey2cAMP81cQa_NXEGs\"/><figcaption>JJ賈曉晨與《再見UFO》劇組一同踏上金像獎紅地氈。（IG@jj_fatumai）</figcaption></figure><p>賈曉晨愛犬離世</p><p>賈曉晨日前在社交平台分享愛犬「豆豆」的遺照。她指於2017年從虐待豆豆的狗主人救牠出來，JJ指雖然較偏心「親生的那三隻」，但她讚豆豆很乖。豆豆近日離世，令JJ很心疼，並嘆生命脆弱。「今天，剛剛，你走了，這麼突然的說走就走，心疼，眼淚止不住的流，束手無措，無力感，生命好脆弱 希望你下輩子能做個人，有人疼的人人再見了，豆豆」。</p><figure><img alt=\"JJ愛犬「豆豆」離世。（小紅書@JJ賈曉晨）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171193752224665600915378.png/vV6MruYDFY7BPRXtSbdvVcK-_4jFLHXJzR9IU80fSFM\"/><figcaption>JJ愛犬「豆豆」離世。（小紅書@JJ賈曉晨）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"JJ發文悼念愛犬。（小紅書@JJ賈曉晨）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260831/1171193749569540096074962.png/LwLxo3f_oaoT0Qh5WCbR0EQKKNZK4Tn7jMWjn4zFo58\"/><figcaption>JJ發文悼念愛犬。（小紅書@JJ賈曉晨）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"JJ賈曉晨指結婚第２日得知老公樊少皇被呃數百萬，相當崩潰。（賈曉晨微博）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240208/832274865674260480895136.jpeg/djTmUwgEHu-NXWhMD4wauaJSBKK3RIXVd1257Xddue0\"/><figcaption>JJ賈曉晨指結婚第２日得知老公樊少皇被呃數百萬，相當崩潰。（賈曉晨微博）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"JJ賈曉晨相夫教女之餘原來仲要守住頭家。（賈曉晨微博）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240208/832275552730746880694730.jpeg/v_J3B3OF4fPG_8XoxTFlHwBzRhexWkiKUXFZxlFxWcY\"/><figcaption>JJ賈曉晨相夫教女之餘原來仲要守住頭家。（賈曉晨微博）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"當年啜乒乓的經典人物賈曉晨（JJ）（《獎門人》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221011/656319851375104000107536.jpeg/1HkAeHeDBoRVJBEaBaUgI5di8vN4zpJ7TXwNSk18DUo\"/><figcaption>當年啜乒乓的經典人物賈曉晨（JJ）（《獎門人》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"當年啜乒乓的經典人物賈曉晨（JJ）（《獎門人》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221011/656319856001683456548192.jpeg/sSNWyrXqjCZwEAI4WK7Gf5n2VcXANQNREnZvyRJ2b8k\"/><figcaption>當年啜乒乓的經典人物賈曉晨（JJ）（《獎門人》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"當年啜乒乓的經典人物賈曉晨（JJ）（《獎門人》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221011/656319860745703424390476.jpeg/xvOP9XFUe_vRM52dvKj7kawUeV4qb4EpLxTJri8Uya4\"/><figcaption>當年啜乒乓的經典人物賈曉晨（JJ）（《獎門人》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"樊少皇。(微博@JJ賈曉晨)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230207/699421661471969280618470.jpeg/eAvMBbbrYVZrAQHBvPhupQWDHGK6gOdRfQ-9qn0Pvao\"/><figcaption>樊少皇。(微博@JJ賈曉晨)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"JJ更不忘調弄老公：「樊少皇，想好了再寫哦！」(微博@JJ賈曉晨)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230207/699421663904796672015326.jpeg/qcX3auToDF-tvAis3GZbiPuJyJwF2x267ZoxnO2aMZw\"/><figcaption>JJ更不忘調弄老公：「樊少皇，想好了再寫哦！」(微博@JJ賈曉晨)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"JJ賈曉晨大女小飯兜。（賈曉晨微博）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241121/936314610498146304879352.jpeg/RHkv6o-5kK8hBvsN2G5N60LhJZOlmo4rTgrNDU4KzQ0\"/><figcaption>JJ賈曉晨大女小飯兜。（賈曉晨微博）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"賈曉晨（JJ）本身擁有回族血統，五官深邃精緻，皮膚白滑得令人羨慕。（IG@jj_fatumai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260205/1096096553052934144085913.jpeg/g_AEfvD9AxZ5yAd4ZLHQvQQx6HdJkZfXCVREAQlURAE\"/><figcaption>賈曉晨（JJ）本身擁有回族血統，五官深邃精緻，皮膚白滑得令人羨慕。（IG@jj_fatumai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"JJ賈曉晨。（IG@jj_fatumai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260422/1123614543319142400517689.jpeg/0szq27eKjIVhGG4YqZu19Xrm4XMNrZXcqNxTS6jcU0s\"/><figcaption>JJ賈曉晨。（IG@jj_fatumai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"JJ賈曉晨擁回族血統。（賈曉晨微博）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240917/912695791272202240461035.jpeg/ZCERgumYIZKakKaKQzqF-W58nDSwpTiQx5M2UceTNlE\"/><figcaption>JJ賈曉晨擁回族血統。（賈曉晨微博）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T15:20:05.620268+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":720,"images":15,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}